	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"&7工作室曾是一个光辉灿烂的文明——汇聚了所有艺术与工艺的枢纽。"
				"&7法师、农夫、发明家和骑士都共同遵守着一个誓言：“团结创造。”"
				""
				"&7四大教团指引着它："
				"&2🌿 &7翠绿之手——土地与炉灶的培育者（舒适之路）。"
				""
				"&5🔮 &7天界人 — 魔法师与学者（魔法路线）。"
				""
				"&c⚔ &7守护者——冒险家与英雄（战斗之路）。"
				""
				"&3⚙ &7探索者——发明家与建造者（科技路线）。"
				""
				"&7每个订单都代表着一颗创世之心的一部分——一颗在他们世界中心跳动的活水晶。"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "cosmeticarmoursmod:crown_helmet"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
					affix_data: {
						sockets: 1
					}
				}
			}
			id: "282DB0E2E5173BB1"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "4304C09302DBC046"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "Hamchiiro"
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"The Birth of the Crystal\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\\n\\nBefore the four orders rose to prominence, the realm of Atelier was a boundless expanse of untouched beauty - a canvas of life.\\n\\nThe skies shimmered with drifting auroras, rivers sang through\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"crystal groves, and the soil itself thrummed faintly, as though listening to a heartbeat just beneath the surface.\\n\\nThat pulse belonged to the living crystal - not forged nor summoned, but birthed by the realm itself.\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"It began as a single mote of condensed mana, formed where all the leylines of Atelier converged. \\n\\nDeep beneath the roots of the first world tree, the mana there began to spiral inward instead of flowing outward, compressing over countless millennia.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"The world's dreams, emotions, and natural will crystallized into being - and from that pressure, the heart of atelier awoke.\\n\\nIt did not think as mortals do, but it felt. It desired harmony, creation, and growth. It's light seeped up through the ground,\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"nurturing life and awakening sentience across the realm.\\n\\nThose drawn to its radiance were the first wanderers - sages, nomads, and creatures who could hear the hum of mana in all things.\\n\\nThey came from distance stars and worlds, following dreams that\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"led them to the shining core of the realm.\\n\\nWhen they beheld the living crystal, they did not find treasure - they found truth. The heart's aura soothed conflict, bridged languages, and illuminated the potential within every soul.\\n\\nFor the first time, beings of vastly\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"different origins shared a single purpose: to protect the song of life that the crystal sang.\\n\\nThis was the dawn of the age of harmony.\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\\n\\n    \\n    The Four Orders \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"The four orders were born from those who dwelled closest to the heart.\\n\\nThe Verdant Hand, who tended the lands shaped by its breath.\\n\\nThe Celestials of the Arcane, who studied the runes that spiraled through its facets.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"The Seekers of Discovery, who delved into the leylines that pulsed through the realm.\\n\\nThe Guardian Order, who vowed to protect the crystal's peace against all that would twist it.\\n\\n\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Each order claimed a fragment of its light - not shards, but echoes, resonating with its core. \\n\\nFor a time, all were unified. The living crystal's glow brought abundance; crops grew even in stone, the seas sang, and no creature feared another.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"But with time came curiousity... and curiousity led to longing.\\n\\nThe orders began to see their reflections in the crystal - their own ideals magnified back at them. In trying to understand it, they began to consume it.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"The more they reached for its power, the dimmer the heart became. Its hum weakened, its colors faded - and the harmony of Atelier began to fracture.\\n\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\"}"
							]
							title: "第一缕光"
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "0AD449A6A1DC790C"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "born_in_chaos_v1:chocolate_heart"
						tag: { }
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "46A26E391D91C73B"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
			]
			subtitle: "和谐的时代"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0A1C82571AEB50E1"
				title: "和谐的时代"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "I. 和谐的时代"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["282DB0E2E5173BB1"]
			description: [
				"&7岁月流逝，和谐破裂。各教派开始相互竞争——都坚信自己的艺术才是创造的最高形式。"
				""
				"&2绿手囤积了生命本身，种植了消耗土壤的、由法力滋养的作物。"
				""
				"&5天界众神超越了凡人领域，撕裂了深渊的帷幕。"
				""
				"&c守护者用星辰之心锻造了武器。"
				""
				"&3寻者建造了能自主搜寻灵魂的机器。"
				""
				"&7每个思想都认为自己能完善创造。每个都忘记了谦卑。"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "botania:rune_pride"
				tag: { }
			}
			id: "1E31441D24C1FECE"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "5460A9398CBB4640"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "Hamchiiro"
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"    The Age of Pride\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\\n\\nWhen the heart's song grew faint, the orders turned inward, each convinced their craft alone could restore its brilliance. Unaware that their own actions are what was causing the heart to fade.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"What began as reverence soon became rivalry.\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\\n\\nThe Verdant Hand twisted the gift of life into dominion. They hoarded forests and creatures, reshaping them to obey their will. Their gardens grew vast and wild, but unnatural with hunger.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"\\nThe Celestials of the Arcane peered too deep in the crystal's glow. In their pursuit of ultimate truth, they tore open the veil between realms, drawing forth the Abyss - a place where mana itself rots and the sky is painted black.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"\\nThe Guardians, or the Aegis Guild, sought to defend what remained - but pride drove them to forge weapons from fallen stars. Their steel burned brighter than any sun, and with each victory, they forgot what they fought to protect.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"\\nThe Seekers of Discovery built wonders to outshine the others. Their machines learned, then thought - and soon, even they could no longer command what they had created.\\n\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"The heart of Atelier could no longer bear the weight of their ambition. Its pulse stuttered, its light fractured - and with it, the harmony of the world.\\n\\nThus ended the age of pride, and from the ruins, the first cracks of the fracturing began to spread.\"}"
							]
							title: "骄傲的降临"
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "77387E92782087FB"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
			]
			subtitle: "傲慢的时代"
			tasks: [{
				id: "07237F311B4A8023"
				title: "傲慢的时代"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "II. 傲慢的时代"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1E31441D24C1FECE"]
			description: [
				"&7维系平衡的创世之心已然破碎。裂隙孕育了深渊，一个魔力倒流、美丑颠倒的领域。守护者——曾为守护创世而生的英雄——皆被其吞噬。"
				""
				"&7它们的转变催生了如今困扰世界的那些伟大怪物和首领。工坊的城市沉没，森林石化，天空黯淡。"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "alshanex_familiars:broken_shield"
				tag: { }
			}
			id: "03732EF2B27FA971"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "605B3965D0B41B17"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "Hamchiiro"
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"     The Fracturing\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\\n\\nThe heart could endure no more. When the order's pride overflowed, the crystal's pulse shattered into countless echoes - each a reflection of their sins.\\n\\nMana flooded the realm\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"like a storm unleashed. Forest withered and bloomed in the same breath, skies bled light, and oceans turned to mirrors of glass. The heart's song twisted into a scream that reshaped all who heard it.\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"\\nThe Verdant Hand became bound to their creations - roots, thorns, and beasts entwined with their flesh.\\n\\nThe Celestials were consumed by the abyss they summoned, their forms now drifting as hollow lights in the void.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"The Guardians melted into their forges, their armor fused to spirit - heroes with no soul left to defend.\\n\\nAnd the seekers were devoured by their own machines, minds copied into cold metal that forgot what life was.\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Thus was born the monsters, the ruins, and the silence that lingered.\\n\\nThe heart of Atelier, now broken, still hums faintly - as if dreaming of what once was..\"}"
							]
							title: "罪恶的碎片"
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "4F46B567589FF907"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
			]
			subtitle: "The Fracture"
			tasks: [{
				id: "47BA386C78EF426F"
				title: "The Fracture"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "III. 破碎之地"
			x: -1.0d
			y: -5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["03732EF2B27FA971"]
			description: [
				"&7岁月流逝，世界愈合了它的伤痕。"
				""
				"&7工作室已化为神话，其遗迹散落在各个世界和维度。只剩下低语——以及那些曾在此生活与爱过之人的遗物。"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "selfexpression:skull_helmet"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
					affix_data: {
						sockets: 1
					}
				}
			}
			id: "68E0F0AD10AF343D"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "64CB5E1DBC7CD163"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "Hamchiiro"
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"     The Silent Age\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\\n\\nAges drifted like dust over glass. The wounds of the fracturing closed over time, though scars still shimmered beneath the soil.\\n\\nForests reclaimed ruins, seas swallowed the forges, and silence grew\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"where songs once filled the air.\\n\\nThe heart's fragments dimmed, buried deep within the earth - their hum now a whisper carried on the wind.\\n\\nThe monsters slept, the mana cooled, and the memory of the orders faded into myth.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Time forgot, the realm forgot.\\n\\nNow only relics remain - half buried stones, ancient runes, and the faint ehco of what once was.\\n\\nThose who walk the realm now do so upon forgotten graves, their footsteps stirring dreams long left behind.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Thus began the silent age, when the world forgot the name Atelier.\\n\\nBut the stars did not.\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\"}"
							]
							resolved: 1b
							title: "褪色的歌谣"
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "2E27E72EB53F80D6"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
			]
			subtitle: "寂静时代"
