			x: 0.5d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["68E0F0AD10AF343D"]
			description: ["&7你是数个世纪以来的第一缕火花。当你建造、耕种、探索、创造时——心脏便会再次苏醒。每一项艺术与勇气的行为，都会唤醒旧日工坊的残片。当四条道路再度合一，创造之心将通过你重获新生。"]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "alexsmobs:soul_heart"
				tag: { }
			}
			id: "45287E0C64B5E01E"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "77E9FE24881DE01B"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "Hamchiiro"
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"    The Reawakening\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\\n\\nYou awaken to stillness. A realm half dreaming, half forgotten. The air hums faintly, as if waiting for something it once knew.\\n\\nEvery spark you kindle, every seed you plant, every stone you shape - \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"the heart feels it. With each act of creation, the mana stirs... faint light blooming once more beneath the earth.\\n\\nYou are not a wanderer by chance. You are the echo of Atelier's will - the first spark in an age of silence.\\n\\n\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Through your hands, the world remembers what it was to live, to dream, to create.\\n\\nWhen all four paths are mended - life, knowledge, courage, and wonder - the heart will awaken anew.\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Its light will not belong to the orders, nor the gods, but to you.\\n\\nFor you are Atelier reborn. The dream made flesh once more.\\n\\n  ₊˚ ✧ ━━━━⊱⋆⊰━━━━ ✧ ₊˚\"}"
							]
							title: "一个新的黎明"
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "098C1C263AFD7794"
					item: {
